{"version":1,"key":"card:531","content":{"id":531,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"背景：在 Electron 应用中需要实现全文搜索功能，技术方案是通过 sqlite 的 FTS5 进行全文检索，但是 FTS5 对中文检索不太行，需要先进行分词，经过调研决定使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nodejieba","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来进行分词。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"30da113a-33d1-4c74-ab53-628432681980","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"问题：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nodejieba","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 需要使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"node-gyp","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 进行 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"rebuild","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 才能构建应用，但是在 Windows 上怎么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"rebuild","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 都不成功，也搜索不到原因为啥","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7d42e1a6-414f-4dc7-95f8-e32b5a4575a6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"borderRadius":"none","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2913e215-2a88-455e-b27d-1f5ff844551d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17c8dfc8-5bc0-4b2f-84a9-94d6e8ceade4.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17c8dfc8-5bc0-4b2f-84a9-94d6e8ceade4.png","width":698},{"children":[{"text":"后来搜索发现了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"@node-rs/jieba","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，不需要进行 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"rebuild","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，直击我的心窝，而且速度还快","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"44a3c40d-bbe5-4f77-9c03-64f86da4497e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"37b3e583-0ec1-44ab-b3a6-78403218f3fa","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_627407c6-9ad6-44a1-a1a4-a71042ebe5dd.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_627407c6-9ad6-44a1-a1a4-a71042ebe5dd.png","width":674.5},{"children":[{"text":"但是在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"import","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 字典时，由于它是动态 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"readFile","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 读取，而不是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"import","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c88e21e3-464f-45f3-9f93-58e968353c1d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import { dict } from \"@node-rs/jieba/dict\";","collabId":"0ddf9c8c-9d2f-43c3-84fa-9d05064e02eb","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5aeba572-088e-42e0-94e6-74ac288b2ac6","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a3f107fc-e0b0-4d41-a421-2097aed4398b"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// dict.js\nconst fs = require('fs')\nconst { join } = require('path')\n\nmodule.exports.dict = fs.readFileSync(join(__dirname, 'dict.txt'))\nmodule.exports.idf = fs.readFileSync(join(__dirname, 'idf.txt'))","collabId":"2b9cad49-2d19-45c1-9e30-687b8e3ec865","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"c85e7f1b-1184-4bdd-a6d3-e80805e8afbd","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"8597596d-98b9-4b6a-9221-617f4ca1116a"},{"children":[{"text":"而我的文件是需要进行打包的，这种情况无法打包到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dict.txt","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"idf.txt","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 文件，读取时就会报错","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2cf32cde-cdd3-4290-a8ae-eb14beaa16aa","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e8f3b199-da05-4bcb-92cb-d92df9d74e88","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_12988927-cba7-4c6e-b902-b298e4da4c3a.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_12988927-cba7-4c6e-b902-b298e4da4c3a.png","width":698},{"children":[{"text":"为了解决这个问题，需要做几件事：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6c881c8b-e3a5-4265-b3be-fbef1f5db2eb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"把读取的文件复制到构建目录下，需要为 Vite 写一个 Rollup 插件","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9f4029fc-1515-4afb-8bab-e988bc689445","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"plugins: [\n  {\n    name: \"jieba-dict-copy\",\n    closeBundle() {\n      // 构建完成后触发\n      fs.copySync(\n        \"node_modules/@node-rs/jieba/dict.txt\",\n        \"dist-electron/main/dict.txt\",\n      );\n      fs.copySync(\n        \"node_modules/@node-rs/jieba/idf.txt\",\n        \"dist-electron/main/idf.txt\",\n      );\n    },\n  },\n],","collabId":"eee5c384-18a3-419c-8cc7-7f17847a5936","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d29f1533-539d-4248-ab4b-39d7a972e855","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"75cd203d-3c9d-47fa-92df-4bddfee66634"}],"collabId":"cc3d3a01-db51-426e-a115-7deda479a366","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"拦截 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"resolve","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数，对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dict.txt","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"idf.txt","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 文件，修改 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"resolve","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 路径为资源路径","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2973b60b-7116-44d4-ab65-76fc7a863184","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalResolve = require.resolve;\nrequire.resolve = function (spec: string, options: any) {\n  if (spec.endsWith(\"dict.txt\") || spec.endsWith(\"idf.txt\")) {\n    const realPath = path.join(\n      app.isPackaged ? process.resourcesPath : __dirname,\n      spec,\n    );\n    return realPath;\n  }\n  return originalResolve(spec, options);\n}","collabId":"9f9b2294-cd4f-41b9-b96b-806caaf20f83","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"05e2fffe-5fbb-41f9-9df3-84ae9fba872f","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b53f7ed9-707c-4fec-973c-ed24eb269846"}],"collabId":"f4cf9212-a487-40c5-9fdf-3d087f3d3618","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"修改 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"electron-builder.yaml","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 文件，将 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dict.txt","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 idf.txt 文件打包到资源目录下，保证生产环境也能读取到文件","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5a46a4f8-36f6-481c-bd05-99e8be8db596","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"extraResources:\n  - from: dist-electron/main/dict.txt\n    to: dict.txt\n    filter: [\"**/*\"]\n  - from: dist-electron/main/idf.txt\n    to: idf.txt\n    filter: [\"**/*\"]","collabId":"dbf616a3-f590-4767-b1c6-147a60d1f8ad","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e5a71f83-8252-41eb-a86c-81816ec1ce25","language":"YAML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"ec2fd394-9aa3-4eab-931c-ce87c0de2fa2"}],"collabId":"e292fe6d-c4d0-4670-9e32-bb2d3fa88fe3","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"8a30f7a3-5dc7-42f0-b03d-3cfe03bab9ab","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"calloutType":"warning","children":[{"children":[{"text":"当初为了保险做了第二步和第三步，不过第二步和第三步是必须的吗？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9996b983-2905-4611-b46c-0c6db5fc6d05","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1625f257-af80-4183-abf1-8378e897405e","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"tags":["Electron/踩坑","踩坑/Electron","全文搜索","分词"],"createTime":1742094950990,"updateTime":1793532527437,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532527437}}